     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Alex,<div><br></div><div>請參考以下回覆:</div><div><br></div><div>1. 目前最新版本應該是 R-3.2.1, 但安裝會有問題.</div><div><br></div><div>2. qAnalyst 目前已從 CRAN 中移除, 如須使用該套件, 可至 archive 下載原始檔編譯後安裝.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/qAnalyst/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/qAnalyst/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238271915000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1uJ5UqZIeKtyKaibATXhro\">http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/qAnalyst/</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>3. 安裝說明, OS: Windows 8.1, 64位元, R-3.2.1-64bits</div><div><br></div><div># step 1: 參考上述網頁下載 <font color=\"#ff0000\">qAnalyst_0.6.4.tar.gz</font></div><div><br></div><div># step 2: 安裝相依套件 SuppDists</div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\">install.packages(&quot;SuppDists&quot;)</font></div><div><br></div><div># step 3: 安裝 qAnalyst 套件會有錯誤 <font color=\"#ff0000\">ERROR: a &#39;NAMESPACE&#39; file is required </font></div><div><br></div><div># step 4: 本項錯誤表示 R-3.0.0 之後版本其套件根目錄須新增 NAMESPACE 檔案.</div><div><br></div><div>將上述 <font color=\"#000000\">qAnalyst_0.6.4.tar.gz 解壓縮, 在 qAnalyst 目錄中新增1個檔案 </font>NAMESPACE , 第1行存放以下內容, 第2行為空白列, 參考附圖</div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\">exportPattern(&quot;.&quot;)</font><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9k0_0OoYB5k/VY05yGh0FEI/AAAAAAAAJrM/gFESCe6O93Q/s1600/NAMESPACE.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9k0_0OoYB5k/VY05yGh0FEI/AAAAAAAAJrM/gFESCe6O93Q/s1600/NAMESPACE.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238271915000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27monYwtL-JvxcHZ5k0Ag8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9k0_0OoYB5k/VY05yGh0FEI/AAAAAAAAJrM/gFESCe6O93Q/s320/NAMESPACE.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"144\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div># step 5: 將上述 qAnalyst 資料夾重新壓縮為 <font color=\"#ff0000\">qAnalyst.tar</font></div><div><br></div><div># step 6: <font color=\"#ff0000\">install.packages(&quot;D:/rdata/qAnalyst_0.6.4.tar/qAnalyst.tar&quot;, repos = NULL, type=&quot;source&quot;)</font></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7VuiOKBgDzQ/VY06ggJCBnI/AAAAAAAAJrU/58kElQovwfA/s1600/install_qAnalyst.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7VuiOKBgDzQ/VY06ggJCBnI/AAAAAAAAJrU/58kElQovwfA/s1600/install_qAnalyst.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238271915000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3D1m_bM1bCRSBF7N7sn2N8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7VuiOKBgDzQ/VY06ggJCBnI/AAAAAAAAJrU/58kElQovwfA/s320/install_qAnalyst.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"147\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"># step 7: 測試 qAnalyst 套件</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7rv--YGHE8g/VY07vjwpq5I/AAAAAAAAJrg/SfHTzTqww6g/s1600/qAnalyst_test.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7rv--YGHE8g/VY07vjwpq5I/AAAAAAAAJrg/SfHTzTqww6g/s1600/qAnalyst_test.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238271915000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mskwNY8LPWwDLMnBKVGkh\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7rv--YGHE8g/VY07vjwpq5I/AAAAAAAAJrg/SfHTzTqww6g/s320/qAnalyst_test.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"170\"></a></p><div># 附檔 <font color=\"#ff0000\">qAnalyst.tar</font> 為壓縮後套件</div><div><br></div><div># end</div><div><br></div><div>Alex Lin於 2015年6月26日星期五 UTC+8下午4時19分57秒寫道：</div></div>"
